<title>USA: Columbia/HCA Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Columbia/HCA Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.61		    $0.53</p>
<p> Net			414,000		  354,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,138,000		4,583,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 678,102		  675,543</p>
<p>	  12   MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.22		    $1.43</p>
<p> Net		    1,505,000		  961,000</p>
<p> Revs		  19,909,000	     17,695,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 677,886		  673,071</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 12-month net and shr figures include $235 million merger and facility consolidation costs and $103 million extraordinary charges on paying off debt.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
